{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2021-08-09 17:49:00', 'title': 'HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES ANNOUNCES PRICING OF 0.670% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2023 AND 2.043% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2028', 'text': 'NEWPORT NEWS, VA., AUG. 09, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES, INC. (NYSE: HII) (“HII” OR THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS PRICED ITS OFFERING OF $400 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 0.670% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2023 (THE “2023 NOTES”) AND $600 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 2.043% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2028 (THE “2028 NOTES” AND, TOGETHER WITH THE 2023 NOTES, THE “NOTES,” AND SUCH OFFERING, THE “NOTES OFFERING”).'}